## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
##+Q 65536

## Tweak GC to run more often
##-env ERL_FULLSWEEP_AFTER 10

## Don't busy-wait idle schedulers (normal, dirty cpu and dirty io). Spinning burns CPU the
## container is billed and throttled for, and starves neighbours on a shared node.
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none

-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 6000 inet_dist_listen_max 6000
